*! VCCI chart scheme for Stata. Brand guide section 08 "Data and charts".
*  Use through vcci_graph.do, which also sets the brand fonts (a scheme cannot) and the decimal comma.
*  Series colours in this order, at most six; Drum Gold is never a series colour (vcci_graph.do: $VCCI_GOLD).

#include stcolor

sequence 2610
label "VCCI"

